# E-Commerce Sales Dashboard using Excel

## 📊 Project Overview

This project is an interactive and functional E-Commerce Sales Dashboard developed using Microsoft Excel. The dashboard provides a clear overview of key business metrics and enables users to analyze sales performance through interactive visualizations and filters.

The goal of this project was to transform raw e-commerce data into meaningful insights that can help understand sales trends, customer demographics, order performance, and overall business performance.

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Excel Formulas
- Data Cleaning
- Data Analysis
- Interactive Dashboard Design

## 📌 Dashboard Features

The dashboard provides insights into:

- Total Orders
- Total Sales/Revenue
- Customer Demographics
- Gender Distribution
- Order Performance
- Sales Trends
- Interactive filtering and analysis

## 📈 Key Skills Demonstrated

- Data cleaning and preparation
- Data aggregation using Pivot Tables
- Creating interactive Pivot Charts
- Building KPI metrics
- Data visualization
- Dashboard design and layout
- Extracting business insights from raw data

## 🎯 Project Objective

The objective of this project was to build an interactive dashboard that converts raw e-commerce data into an easy-to-understand visual report. The dashboard can help stakeholders quickly monitor important KPIs and identify patterns in the data.

## 📂 Project Files

- `ecommerce-blank.xlsx` – Excel workbook containing the data analysis and interactive dashboard.

## 🚀 How to Use

1. Download the Excel workbook from this repository.
2. Open the file using Microsoft Excel.
3. Navigate to the Dashboard sheet.
4. Use the available filters and interactive elements to explore the data.
5. Analyze the KPIs and visualizations to understand e-commerce performance.

